{'symbol': 'ADBE', 'date': '2021-12-09 08:00:00', 'title': 'ADOBE DIGITAL PRICE INDEX: ONLINE INFLATION HITS RECORD HIGH', 'text': 'SAN JOSE, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ADOBE (NASDAQ:ADBE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LATEST ONLINE INFLATION DATA FOR THE MONTH OF NOVEMBER 2021. ONLINE PRICES HIT A RECORD HIGH AT A 3.5% YEAR-OVER-YEAR (YOY) INCREASE WHILE PRICES ARE DOWN 2% MONTH-OVER-MONTH (MOM) DUE TO HOLIDAY DISCOUNTS. THIS IS THE HIGHEST YOY INCREASE SINCE ADOBE FIRST BEGAN TRACKING THE DIGITAL ECONOMY IN 2014, AND IT MARKS THE 18TH CONSECUTIVE MONTH OF YOY ONLINE INFLATION. APPAREL WAS A STANDOUT CATEGORY WITH PRICES UP 17.3% YOY'}